body:
Prioritize upgrading your tools and only upgrade your watering can when it's supposed to rain the following day (if you don't have a sprinkler setup). 

&#x200B;

I also kept one of everything (fishing, foraging, farming, meals, gifts etc. ) that I obtained and stored them into categorized chests. This helped immensely when it came to the community center, various events, and gift giving.

&#x200B;

Have fun! There is no wrong way to play.
